
### 1. Get All Complaints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Accept: application/json


### 2. Create New Complaint
POST http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abhishek",
  "email": "abhishek@gmail.com",
  "category": "Road",
  "description": "Garbage has not been collected for several days",
  "status": "Pending",
  "location": "Kolhapur",
  "priority": "High",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-10"
}


### 3. Update Complaint ID 1 Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}


### 4. Verify Updated Complaint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Accept: application/json


### 5. Update Complaint ID 1 to Resolved
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}


### 6. Verify Final Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints
Accept: application/json

### Test Dashboard Statistics API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/statistics

### Test Category Analytics API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/complaints/analytics/categories

